sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-gekko-gecko-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gekko-gecko-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gekko-gecko-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Gekko gecko Turing wavenumber at 242 µm (Holocene, Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 86.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 scores the executed sidecar. Linear k_c is calibrated to 242 µm; the saturated ring centroid is 232.994 µm (not forced equal). Across six diffusivity scales, Pearson r of analytic versus measured wavelength is 0.9999999999999989 and RMSE is 10.079 µm. Equal-diffusivity ablation std is 0.05082 against a patterned std of 1.082. The Dupont dorsum crop has nearest-neighbour spacing fraction 0.046 versus 0.0939 on the render, coherency 0.4594 versus 0.734, and grayscale KS D 0.4307. Computer-vision similarity of the 12-frame 720×540 GIF to that crop is 88.5. Overall 86.8/100 (faithfulness 85.6, reproducibility 89.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 82, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 84, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-gekko-gecko-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/gif, 3094317 B, 720×540 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 724f685b336c401afa62dbb64796d30e8f6cf6781c75a8d9cb10c51f8f18ac71 (sha256 724f685b336c401afa62dbb64796d30e8f6cf6781c75a8d9cb10c51f8f18ac71), spec_fingerprint 27a9ed0ed17fc21dd4fe57b407600983fabe4a2853287d2fa00a88e37c342dc7. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 27a9ed0ed17fc21dd4fe57b407600983fabe4a2853287d2fa00a88e37c342dc7; artifact_sha256: 724f685b336c401afa62dbb64796d30e8f6cf6781c75a8d9cb10c51f8f18ac71; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0/Gekko_gecko_dorsum_cc-by-sa.jpg=92d9092794d8c8df..., datasets/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0/Gekko_gecko_full_cc-by-sa.jpg=09aac21e60203080..., datasets/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=b00877ae162067f0...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-gekko-gecko-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation for a two-species reaction-diffusion system. | Murray 1981 use of that wavelength as a coat pre-pattern. | Manukyan 2017 and Fofonjka 2021: reptile skin can carry a mesoscopic reaction-diffusion pattern (Timon, not Gekko). | Saenko 2013: gekkotan color colocalizes structural and pigment cells (Phelsuma, not Gekko).; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg field with (a, b) = (0.137, 0.863) and diffusion ratio 1.35 times critical, calibrated so k_c = argmax sigma(k) gives 242 µm. | Diffusivity sweep, equal-diffusivity ablation, reaction-off control, and orange-ocellus segmentation of the Dupont dorsum crop.; transfer_boundary: 242 µm is the slot's primordium detail scale. The photograph has no scale bar, so it is not a micrometre measurement. | Adult spot spacing is reported only as a fraction of frame width.; does_not_claim: That adult Tokay ocelli are 242 µm apart. | That the nonlinear ring centroid equals the linear k_c (measured 232.994 µm). | That Tokay chromatophores implement the Timon scale automaton. | That granular scale texture is produced by this two-species field.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/model-fidelity, pressure P=0.9]: A second assessor from another provider has not scored this audit.",
            "remediation needed: R5: Independent second assessor was not run.",
            "remediation needed: R7: One photograph. A population of Tokay dorsa would test whether 0.046 spacing fraction is typical." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.868"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single agent; second assessor not run)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

